              "Armor Class 12 (natural armor)",
              "Hit Points 76 (8d10 + 32)",
              "Speed 40 ft.",
              "STR DEX CON INT WIS CHA",
              "22 (+6) 9 (-1) 17 (+3) 3 (-4) 11 (0) 6 (-2)",
              "Senses passive Perception 10",
              "Languages —",
              "Challenge 4 (1,100 XP)",
              "Trampling Charge. If the bantha moves flat least 20 feet straight toward a creature and then hits it with a gore attack on the same turn, that target must succeed on a DC 14 Strength saving throw or be knocked prone. If the target is prone, the bantha can make one stomp attack against it as a bonus action.",
              "ACTIONS",
