              "DESTROYER DROID",
              "Destroyer droids, also known as Droidekas or rollies, are a type of heavy battle droid originally crafted by",
              "Colicoids. It has a reputation for deadliness due to its resilience and firepower, as well as the fear it can instill in even the most powerful Jedi. They are also used for executions. Destroyer droids are equipped with dual built-in blaster cannons and a built-in deflector shield generator. Due to their ponderous nature, destroyer droids have a ball-form that they can transform into, granting them great speed.",
              "BX-5C COMMANDO DROID",
