              "Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 36 (8d8) piercing damage, or 18 (4d8) piercing damage if the squad has half its hit points or fewer. On a successful save, it takes half as much damage.",
              "DEMOLITIONS TROOPER",
              "Demolition Troopers were heavily armored specialists who carried a variety of explosive devices and SE-14C blaster pistols.",
