              "Trampling Charge. If the fathier moves flat least 20 ft. straight toward a creature and then hits it with a hooves attack on the same turn, that target must succeed on a DC 14 Strength saving throw or be knocked prone. If the target is prone, the fathier can make another attack with its hooves against it as a bonus action.",
              "ACTIONS",
