              "ROCK WART",
              "Rock warts were orange/brown insect-like crustaceans found on many planets. Their bite delivered a neurotoxin to their victim, which was then used as an incubator for up to twenty eggs.",
              "SCURRIER",
              "Scurriers are a species of small creatures native to",
              "Tatooine. The bipedal runners sport an elongated snout, horn-like appendages, and a pointed tail. They are present in the streets of cities like Mos Eisley and in the vicinity of more isolated settlements like the Lars moisture farm.",
