              "ACTIONS",
              "Ram. Melee Weapon Attack: +5 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. Hit: 2 (1d4) kinetic damage.",
              "SIBIAN HOUND",
              "Medium beast, unaligned",
              "Armor Class 13 (natural armor)",
              "Hit Points 11 (2d8+2)",
