              "ACTIONS",
              "Talons. Melee Weapon Attack: +3 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. Hit: 1 kinetic damage.",
              "WOODOO",
              "Woodoo are massive flightless reptavians indigenous to Tatooine. Woodoo are popular game for big game hunters, as their meat was rather tasty and their bones sold well as jewelry.",
              "ZALAACA",
              "Zalaacas are swift, intelligent, and fierce omnivores native to the Gungan swamps of Naboo. Rather little is known about their habits. They seem to dwell primarily in woody uplands, yet are strong swimmers. Narglatch will not attack adult-sized zalaacas.",
              "WOODOO",
              "Large beast, unaligned",
              "Armor Class 12 (natural armor)",
              "Hit Points 68 (8d10 + 24)",
