              "Beak. Melee Weapon Attack: +6 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. Hit: 15 (2d10 + 4) kinetic damage.",
              "Talons. Melee Weapon Attack: +6 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. Hit: 8 (1d10 + 4) kinetic damage.",
              "Shriek (Recharge 6). The woodoo lets out a deafening shriek in a 60-foot cone. All creatures that can hear it must make a DC 13 Constitution saving throw. On a failure, a creature takes 17 (5d6) sonic damage and is deafened for 1 minute. The creature can repeat this saving throw flat end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself. On a success, a creature takes half",
