              "RING OF NOVICE FORCE STORING",
              "Adventuring gear (finger), standard Requires attunement This ring stores force powers cast into it, holding them until the attuned wearer uses them. The ring can store up to 2 levels worth of force powers flat a time. When found, it contains 1d3 − 1 levels of stored force powers chosen by the GM.",
