              "DART (AVERAGE)",
              "Consumable (ammunition), premium You have a +1 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with this enhanced wrist launcher dart, which deals 1d6 kinetic damage on a hit. This bonus is in addition to any bonuses granted by the weapon. Once the dart has been fired, it no longer gives a bonus.",
