              "VITAPAC (IMPROVED)",
              "Consumable (medpac), prototype This fast-acting syringe grants a revitalizing boost. As an action, you can use this vitapac to restore expended Hit Dice to a beast or humanoid within 5 feet. The creature immediately regains five Hit Dice. If the creature has spent Hit Dice of different sizes, determine which Hit Dice are restored randomly.",
              "VITAPAC (SUPERIOR)",
