              "DC 15 Strength check. While the harpoon is stuck in the target, you are connected to the target by a 60 foot cable. While connected in this manner, you can use your bonus action to activate the reel, pulling yourself to the location if the target is your size or larger. A creature or object smaller than you is pulled to you. Alternatively, you can opt to release the cable (no action required).",
